(6608149, 986379, 124982, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting, detail and composition of this image. Quite wonderful. Only thing that kind of "ruins" it for me is the plastic-y pipe...it looks out of place. A more "mature" pipe with history would''ve suited the composition better. Anyway, that''s just nitpicky, I voted this in my Top 3.</td>', 'I love the lighting, detail and composition of this image. Quite wonderful. Only thing that kind of "ruins" it for me is the plastic-y pipe...it looks out of place. A more "mature" pipe with history would''ve suited the composition better. Anyway, that''s just nitpicky, I voted this in my Top 3.', '2011-12-01 20:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608154, 986316, 124982, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why I like this image, since compositionally it''s quite ordinary. What puts it over the top is the choice of lighting and honestly, the interesting facial characteristics of the model. Very nicely done, top 3 for me.</td>', 'I''m not sure why I like this image, since compositionally it''s quite ordinary. What puts it over the top is the choice of lighting and honestly, the interesting facial characteristics of the model. Very nicely done, top 3 for me.', '2011-12-01 20:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6608155, 986120, 124982, '<td valign="top">Suspect you have a winner, Robert. <br/> <br/>Edit: I''ll be interested to hear how you processed this...it has a feel of maybe a B&amp;W layer overlay?</td>', 'Suspect you have a winner, Robert.  Edit: I''ll be interested to hear how you processed this...it has a feel of maybe a B&W layer overlay?', '2011-12-01 20:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
