(6609256, 986433, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is very, very good. I think to make it perfect you have to add some fill light on camera right to take out the shadow cast on your chest by the arm and glass. Also to light up the elbow underneath. I don''t know if this is a self portrait or not, but I would think you would want the head of the model centered on the background spot light too.</td>', 'This is very, very good. I think to make it perfect you have to add some fill light on camera right to take out the shadow cast on your chest by the arm and glass. Also to light up the elbow underneath. I don''t know if this is a self portrait or not, but I would think you would want the head of the model centered on the background spot light too.', '2011-12-02 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609257, 986049, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great looking beard. Well groomed! For the shot, I think the noise reduction or the use of unsharp mask has blurred the details. The texture of the beard is lost as well as any texture on the skin.</td>', 'Great looking beard. Well groomed! For the shot, I think the noise reduction or the use of unsharp mask has blurred the details. The texture of the beard is lost as well as any texture on the skin.', '2011-12-02 21:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6609258, 985054, 10785, '<td valign="top">Looks like Salvador Dali! I am not sure if you were going for warm colors, but the skin is awfully yellow with uneven tones. Otherwise interesting full frame facial shot!</td>', 'Looks like Salvador Dali! I am not sure if you were going for warm colors, but the skin is awfully yellow with uneven tones. Otherwise interesting full frame facial shot!', '2011-12-02 21:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
