(6651402, 986337, 60173, '<td valign="top">This really should have scored better than it did. It has that aged historic feel to it, but clearly the studs and tie bring it to modern day. I like images that take you back, but have that edge to them. The lighting is nice, and the crop is unusual. Not unusual in a bad way, but unusual in a perfect example of when to break the rules.</td>', 'This really should have scored better than it did. It has that aged historic feel to it, but clearly the studs and tie bring it to modern day. I like images that take you back, but have that edge to them. The lighting is nice, and the crop is unusual. Not unusual in a bad way, but unusual in a perfect example of when to break the rules.', '2012-01-21 15:30:55.000000', NULL, 0),
